// The ground floor of Ash Tower, below the ashTowerStairs gate. The first
// visit (without mid's spectralLens) finds Team Eclipse's siege: the lair
// towerSiege moves hidden -> found here. With the lens, east.ashTowerLens
// plays instead; the top floor is the contract beat east.ashTower.

## The hall of candles

::bg{location="ash-tower-hall" time="night"}
::music{action="change" mood="eerie" volume="down"}
@narrator: Inside, Ash Tower is candles: hundreds of them, on every ledge, for every monster whose name is carved into the walls.
::set{run.lair.towerSiege = "found" when="run.lair.towerSiege == 'hidden'"}
::auto{character="ashgroveMourner" anchor="left" action="enter"}
@ashgroveMourner: Are you going up? Don't go up. The men in black went up. My puffsong's candle is up there and I can't reach it.
::auto{character="ashgroveMourner" action="exit"}
@narrator: At the foot of the stairs the air goes cold. Something is standing on the third step. When you look at it, it is not there.
@narrator: Scratched into the banister, fresh: EYES THAT SEE THE DEAD ARE SOLD IN SILVERCREST. ASK AT THE GAME CORNER.
